<body>
    <h1>Platform Management</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"contentLayout2">
 <div class=3D"columnLayout two-right-sidebar" data-layout=3D"two-right-sid=
ebar">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <h1 id=3D"PlatformManagement-Purpose">Purpose</h1>
    <p>The Compass platform serves as a container to host and provide user =
access to NBIN's integrated app ecosystem.&nbsp; Platform Management capabi=
lities allow the right apps to be securely distributed to the right firms a=
nd users in line with their services agreement with NBIN.</p>
    <h1 id=3D"PlatformManagement-KeyJourneys">Key Journeys</h1>
    <p>Feature Lifecycle Management</p>
    <p>Firm Lifecycle Management</p>
    <p>User Lifecycle Management</p>
    <p>Client Platform Access</p>
    <p>Employee Platform Access</p>
   </div>
  </div>
  <div class=3D"cell aside" data-type=3D"aside">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <p>
     <style type=3D"text/css">/*<![CDATA[*/
div.rbtoc1790108333180 {padding: 0px;}
div.rbtoc1790108333180 ul {margin-left: 0px;}
div.rbtoc1790108333180 li {margin-left: 0px;padding-left: 0px;}

/*]]>*/</style>
    </p>
    <div class=3D"toc-macro rbtoc1790108333180">
     <ul class=3D"toc-indentation">
      <li><a href=3D"#PlatformManagement-Purpose">Purpose</a></li>
      <li><a href=3D"#PlatformManagement-KeyJourneys">Key Journeys</a></li>
      <li><a href=3D"#PlatformManagement-CapabilityMap">Capability Map</a><=
/li>
      <li><a href=3D"#PlatformManagement-KeyPlatformConcepts">Key Platform =
Concepts</a>
       <ul class=3D"toc-indentation">
        <li><a href=3D"#PlatformManagement-PlatformFeatureManagement">Platf=
orm Feature Management</a>
         <ul class=3D"toc-indentation">
          <li><a href=3D"#PlatformManagement-RelationshipbetweenFirm360andP=
latformManagement">Relationship between Firm360 and Platform Management</a>=
</li>
         </ul></li>
        <li><a href=3D"#PlatformManagement-PlatformFeature&amp;DataAccess">=
Platform Feature &amp; Data Access</a>
         <ul class=3D"toc-indentation">
          <li><a href=3D"#PlatformManagement-FeatureRepresentation">Feature=
 Representation</a></li>
          <li><a href=3D"#PlatformManagement-Firm&amp;UserPackages">Firm &a=
mp; User Packages</a></li>
         </ul></li>
       </ul></li>
     </ul>
    </div>
    <p></p>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <h1 id=3D"PlatformManagement-CapabilityMap"><span style=3D"letter-spaci=
ng: -0.01em;">Capability Map</span></h1>
    <p><img class=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"468" style=3D"width:126=
1px;max-width: 100%;" src=3D"97dc4c302e9db42904a773a222c2d19b45092beec35216=
8e2b7a79f3d885212f" height=3D"324"></p>
    <p>Child pages go into each capability in more detail.</p>
    <h1 id=3D"PlatformManagement-KeyPlatformConcepts">Key Platform Concepts=
</h1>
    <h2 id=3D"PlatformManagement-PlatformFeatureManagement">Platform Featur=
e Management</h2>
    <p>Compass is the source of truth for:</p>
    <ol>
     <li data-uuid=3D"b215f9b0-6cf9-472a-a8f1-7854b257edaa">Integrated feat=
ures available / assignable on the platform and requestable features off-pl=
atform</li>
     <li>The&nbsp;<em>implementation&nbsp;</em>of firm subscriptions&nbsp;a=
s defined in Firm360 or wherever the global source of firm subscriptions li=
ve (the latter can include off-platform, unmanaged subscriptions)</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"eab6b26c-a179-43ad-9b04-849b32877265">Registered plat=
form users within in each firm&nbsp;</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"83dd2252-609a-429c-bc27-810667ea8241">User identity, =
feature access and data access
      <ol>
       <li data-uuid=3D"b87e6ed3-ca01-4d02-8c95-a87e54a3d78b">This also mea=
ns Compass is the source of truth for user subscriptions</li>
      </ol></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"1afa89aa-92c4-48a6-81c1-2eda739f9dfa">Firm preference=
s (core feature visibility, white-labelling, communications settings, etc.)=
</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"a9182220-ad9c-41b1-b45d-203a012ce1e2">User preference=
s (language preference, contact info, default module, communications settin=
gs, etc.)</li>
    </ol>
    <p>It is not a source of truth for:</p>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"ce56a783-4baf-4121-8d17-a6e25661152b">Firm subscripti=
ons =E2=86=92 Firm360 maintains a complete view of all firm products &amp; =
services include non-digital&nbsp;/ non-integrated services outside of Comp=
ass</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"07543e0a-b958-4e4e-bfaf-89ac95df3bff">Firm usage &amp=
; billing =E2=86=92 this would be derived based on contract arrangements, o=
f which the logic lives outside of the platform</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"af6d6568-b606-412f-942f-6b034de499cf">Firm hierarchy =
=E2=86=92 firm onboarding &amp; implementation processes include non-Compas=
s setup definitions, captured in Firm360</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"a26eb2c9-fd91-42c6-88b4-98aa7e209472">Granular sub-fe=
ature access profiles in 3rd party apps outside of Core</li>
    </ul>
    <h3 id=3D"PlatformManagement-RelationshipbetweenFirm360andPlatformManag=
ement">Relationship between Firm360 and Platform Management</h3>
    <p><img class=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"468" style=3D"width:794=
px;max-width: 100%;" src=3D"b0871c1a9d31b3027651d18626d5cef9604f28ae2ae6041=
bc74849ae870f7a8b" height=3D"209"></p>
    <h2 id=3D"PlatformManagement-PlatformFeature&amp;DataAccess">Platform F=
eature &amp; Data Access</h2>
    <p>The platform is a single-tenant environment where all firms and data=
 exist under a single instance of the platform.&nbsp; <span style=3D"letter=
-spacing: 0.0px;">The platform enforces segregation of firm environments th=
rough enforcement of the firm hierarchy.&nbsp; Firm context is therefore us=
ed across all apps to determine feature and data access rights, including i=
n user provisioning.&nbsp; In other words, u</span><span style=3D"letter-sp=
acing: 0.0px;">ser ID's belong to a unique firm ID, and the user ID can onl=
y access available features &amp; data as configured for that firm.</span><=
/p>
    <h3 id=3D"PlatformManagement-FeatureRepresentation"><span style=3D"lett=
er-spacing: 0.0px;">Feature Representation</span></h3>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"b659057f-29a4-422c-82d7-28d95b462997">Represented by =
a collection of Resources</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"215968c7-2263-48f3-bb8b-311f84f694a9">There are diffe=
rent types of resources, e.g.:
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"451e7427-0d20-4460-8ff8-237b0b2461bd">Module resour=
ces control the UI</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"e0362d27-41c6-4be6-a870-b42ae44b5d5d">Entitlement r=
esources control actions within a feature</li>
      </ul></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"a4354d61-2a7e-47b6-9240-48a3da6f2adc">Both UI and bac=
kend checks for whether a user has a resource assigned to validate the user=
's feature entitlements</li>
    </ul>
    <h3 id=3D"PlatformManagement-Firm&amp;UserPackages">Firm &amp; User Pac=
kages&nbsp;</h3>
    <p>The platform uses the concept of "packages", or collections of Resou=
rces, to define feature scope.&nbsp; Each firm is assigned a firm package w=
hich contains eligible features for that FIRM, and each user is assigned a =
user package which behaves as a pre-defined user role and contains eligible=
 features for that ROLE.</p>
    <p><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">What a user has in the platfo=
rm is bound by the&nbsp;</span><em style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">interse=
ction </em><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">of the assigned firm + us=
er package.</span></p>
    <p>
     <br>
    </p>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
